From: Markus Volk <f_l_k@t-online.de>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 00:30:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] calendar-server: take a const ICalProperty in the getter callback

libical 4.0 declares the ICalProperty getters with a const
ICalProperty argument, so the callback type has to match.

Upstream-Status: Pending

--- a/calendar-server/calendar-server.c
+++ b/calendar-server/calendar-server.c
@@ -106,7 +106,7 @@
 get_time_from_property (ECalClient            *cal,
                         ICalComponent         *icomp,
                         ICalPropertyKind       prop_kind,
-                        ICalTime * (* get_prop_func) (ICalProperty *prop),
+                        ICalTime * (* get_prop_func) (const ICalProperty *prop),
                         ICalTimezone          *default_zone,
                         ICalTime              **out_itt,
                         ICalTimezone          **out_timezone)
